    "preamble": "Ashok vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 22 November, 2018",
    "facts": "The sample was taken on 12/10/2010 and first tested by State Food Laboratory on 13/10/2010. Report was received by the Food Inspector on 22/12/2010 and complaint was filed on 18/01/2011. On the same day, notice was received by the complainant and in such situation, he could not avail his valuable right of examination of testing of second sample of the article alleged misbranded/adulterated article.",
    "arguments": "It is submitted by the learned counsel for the petitioner that the packet of biscuit which was found misbranded/ adulterated was manufactured in May, 2010 with the expiry of six months.",
